Ula gadhung sijining jinis &lt;a href="ula"&gt;ula&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé &lt;a href="wisa"&gt;wisa&lt;/a&gt; ènthèng saka &lt;a href="familia"&gt;suku&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Colubridae"&gt;Colubridae&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng liya antarané ular pucuk, oray pucuk (&lt;a href="bahasa%20Sunda"&gt;Sd.&lt;/a&gt;), lan ing &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt; karan Oriental whip-snake lan Asian vine snake.
Kasebat ula gadhung amarga ula iki duwé warna kang madarupa karo wit &lt;a href="gadhung"&gt;gadhung&lt;/a&gt; (Dioscorea hispida) kang wernane ijo &lt;a href="pupus"&gt;pupus&lt;/a&gt;, saliyané uga tembung gadhung uga tegesé ijo.
<h2>Pemerian</h2>
Pemerian.
Ula iki wernane ijo, kuru aking. kadhangkala ana kang rupané soklat semu kuning utawa smeu putih, mligi kanggone ula kng isih enom. Dawane bisa nganti 2 mèter, sanajan lumrahé mung 1.5 mèter, lan setelon punjul saka dawane wujud buntut kang kaya déné &lt;a href="pecut"&gt;pecut&lt;/a&gt;.
Endhase dawa lan lancip, jelas bedane saka gulu kang kuru aking kaya déné pang gegodhongan.
<h2>Kebiasaan</h2>
Kebiasaan.
Ula iki lumrahé tinemu ing &lt;a href="kebon"&gt;kebon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pomahan"&gt;pomahan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="grumbul"&gt;grumbul&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt;, seneng nyaru ana ing antarané gegodhongan lan grumbul, uga kadhang mudhun ing lemah, se&lt;a href="suket"&gt;suket&lt;/a&gt;an lan nyabrang &lt;a href="dalan"&gt;dalan&lt;/a&gt;.
Ula iki sesaba ing wektu &lt;a href="awan"&gt;awan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="diurnal"&gt;diurnal&lt;/a&gt;), golèk pangan rupa &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cecak"&gt;cecak&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="bunglon"&gt;bunglon&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="kadhal"&gt;kadhal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="manuk"&gt;manuk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="mamalia"&gt;mamalia&lt;/a&gt; cilik.
Ula iki &lt;a href="ovovivipar"&gt;ovovivipar&lt;/a&gt; ya iku endhog ula iki netes ing jero awake lan anaké metu kaya déné lair, cacah anaké nganti 9 iji.
Ing Sumatra, ula iki ditemoni wiwit saka cedhak pasisir nganti ketinggian 1300 m dpl.
<h2>Sub spésies lan sebarane</h2>
Sub spésies lan sebarane.
Ahaetulla prasina duwé 4 subspesies, ya iku:
<ul>
<li>A.p. prasina (&lt;a href="Friedrich%20Boie"&gt;Boie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1827"&gt;1827&lt;/a&gt;). Tinemu ing &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kulon, &lt;a href="Bangladesh"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, mangetan nganti &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;), mangidul ngliwati &lt;a href="Burma"&gt;Burma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indochina"&gt;Indochina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ujung%20Malaya"&gt;Ujung Malaya&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; nyebar ing pulo &lt;a href="Sumatra"&gt;Sumatra&lt;/a&gt; (kalebu &lt;a href="Simeulue"&gt;Simeulue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nias"&gt;Nias&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mentawai"&gt;Mentawai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Riau"&gt;Riau&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bangka"&gt;Bangka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Belitung"&gt;Belitung&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Borneo"&gt;Borneo&lt;/a&gt; (kalebu &lt;a href="Natuna"&gt;Natuna&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sebuku"&gt;Sebuku&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Sulawesi"&gt;Sulawesi&lt;/a&gt; (kalebu &lt;a href="Buton"&gt;Buton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Sula"&gt;Kapuloan Sula&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sangihe"&gt;Sangihe&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok"&gt;Lombok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sumbawa"&gt;Sumbawa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ternate"&gt;Ternate&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
