<li>A.p. suluensis (&lt;a href="M.%20Gaulke"&gt;Gaulke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;), nyebar ing &lt;a href="kapuloanSulu"&gt;kapuloanSulu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>A.p. medioxima &lt;a href="James%20Lazell"&gt;Lazell&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
