<doc id="90788" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=90788" title="Upil">
Upil

Upil ya iku barang cilik kang tinemu ing sajeroning bolongan &lt;a href="irung"&gt;irung&lt;/a&gt;, wujud '&lt;a href="umbel"&gt;umbel&lt;/a&gt; kang garing nalika '&lt;a href="ambegan"&gt;ambegan&lt;/a&gt;. Sawijining &lt;a href="membran"&gt;membran&lt;/a&gt; 'ing sajeroning 'irung tansah teles lan pigunane kanggo nyaring &lt;a href="bledug"&gt;bledug&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kruma"&gt;kruma&lt;/a&gt; kang mèlu lumebu 'irung nalika 'unjal napas. Rereget kang tansaya akèh mau banjur cumanthel 'ing &lt;a href="rambut%20irung"&gt;rambut 'irung&lt;/a&gt; kang uga ana kono, dadi garing 'amarga kena hawa kang liwat bareng ambegan mula di'arani 'upil.

