Prasasti Gandasuli

Prasasti Gandasuli iku &lt;a href="prasasti"&gt;prasasti&lt;/a&gt; tinggalan &lt;a href="Karajan%20Mataram%20Kuna"&gt;Karajan Mataram Kuna&lt;/a&gt; nalika panguwasaning &lt;a href="Wangsa%20Syailendra"&gt;Wangsa Syailendra&lt;/a&gt;. Prasasti iki katemon ing runtuhan &lt;a href="Candhi%20Gandasuli"&gt;Candhi Gandasuli&lt;/a&gt;, ing Désa &lt;a href="Gandasuli%2C%20Bulu%2C%20Temanggung"&gt;Gandasuli&lt;/a&gt;, Kacamatan &lt;a href="Bulu%2C%20Temanggung"&gt;Bulu, Temanggung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawa%20Tengah"&gt;Jawa Tengah&lt;/a&gt;. Sing kapacak ngetokaké prasasti iki ya iku sawijining (pangeran) jejuluk &lt;a href="Rakai%20Rakarayan%20Patapan%20Pu%20Palar"&gt;Rakai Rakarayan Patapan Pu Palar&lt;/a&gt;, sing dadi adhi ipé raja Mataram, &lt;a href="Rakai%20Garung"&gt;Rakai Garung&lt;/a&gt;.
