<doc id="90873" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=90873" title="Assam">
Assam

Assam (&lt;a href="Basa%20Assam"&gt;Assam&lt;/a&gt;: অসম Ôxôm) ana ing pérangan &lt;a href="lor-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;lor-wétan&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; kanthi ibu kuthané &lt;a href="Dispur"&gt;Dispur&lt;/a&gt; — sing saiki lumebu sajeroning région &lt;a href="Guwahati"&gt;Guwahati&lt;/a&gt;. Papané ing pérangan wétan sikil pagunungan &lt;a href="Himalaya"&gt;Himalaya&lt;/a&gt;, dikupengi déning &lt;a href="Arunachal%20Pradesh"&gt;Arunachal Pradesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nagaland"&gt;Nagaland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Manipur"&gt;Manipur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mizoram"&gt;Mizoram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tripura"&gt;Tripura&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Meghalaya"&gt;Meghalaya&lt;/a&gt;. Assam lan kutha gedhéné, Guwahati wujud &lt;a href="gapura"&gt;gapura&lt;/a&gt; nuju wewengkon lor-wétan saka India, ing ngendi kapitu &lt;a href="praja"&gt;praja&lt;/a&gt; ing lor-wétan iki ditepungi kanthi jeneng seven sisters. Praja iki kagandhèng karo wewengkon India liyané liwat wewatesan antarané Assam karo &lt;a href="Benggala%20Kulon"&gt;Benggala Kulon&lt;/a&gt; sing ditepungi kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Koridor%20Siliguri"&gt;Koridor Siliguri&lt;/a&gt; utawa asring diarani Chicken's Neck. Assam uga wewatesan karo nagara &lt;a href="Bhutan"&gt;Bhutan&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih &lt;a href="lor-kulon"&gt;lor-kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan loro &lt;a href="wewatesan%20internasional"&gt;wewatesan internasional&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Bangladesh"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt; ing pérangan &lt;a href="kulon"&gt;kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kidul-kulon"&gt;kidul-kulon&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="27%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;27 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, pamaréntah Assam ngajokaké panggantian jeneng dadi &lt;a href="Asom"&gt;Asom&lt;/a&gt; lan sawisé disarujuki saiki kanggo jeneng resmi.
