Rocket Rockers gadhah sekawan album témbang, ya iku &lt;a href="Sundtrack%20for%20Your%20Life"&gt;Sundtrack for Your Life&lt;/a&gt; (2002), &lt;a href="Ras%20Bebas"&gt;Ras Bebas&lt;/a&gt; (2004), &lt;a href="Better%20Season"&gt;Better Season&lt;/a&gt; (2008), lan &lt;a href="Tons%20of%20Friends"&gt;Tons of Friends&lt;/a&gt; (2011).
