<doc id="91241" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=91241" title="Royal Society">
Royal Society

The Royal Society of London for the Improvement of Natural Knowledge, utawa kang kondhang kanthi sesebutan Royal Society, ya iku perkumpulan kang diadegaké ing taun &lt;a href="1660"&gt;1660&lt;/a&gt; kanthi tujuan majokake ngèlmu kawruh. Organisasi iki duwé piyagam panyengkuyungé raja &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; wektu iku, &lt;a href="Charles%20II%20dari%20Inggris"&gt;Charles II&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1662. Keanggotaan (fellowship) diresmekake sawisé dipilih déning anggota (fellow) kang wis ana. Anggota disyaratke duwé kewarganagaraan salah siji anggota &lt;a href="nagara-nagara%20persemakmuran"&gt;nagara-nagara persemakmuran&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Irlandia"&gt;Républik Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;. Warga nagara nonpersemakmuran utawa Républik Irlandia bisa dadi anggota asing (foreign member). Tokoh-tokoh kaya &lt;a href="Isaac%20Newton"&gt;Isaac Newton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Christopher%20Wren"&gt;Christopher Wren&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charles%20Darwin"&gt;Charles Darwin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ernest%20Rutherford"&gt;Ernest Rutherford&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dorothy%20Hodgkin"&gt;Dorothy Hodgkin&lt;/a&gt; ya iku anggota Royal Society.
