<doc id="91445" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=91445" title="30 Seconds to Mars">
30 Seconds to Mars

30 Seconds to Mars ya iku band &lt;a href="rock%20alternatif"&gt;rock alternatif&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;. Band iki digawé rikala taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Jared%20Leto"&gt;Jared Leto&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Shannon%20Leto"&gt;Shannon Leto&lt;/a&gt;. Band iki uga duwé album 3, ya iku "30 Seconds to Mars" (2002), "A Beautiful Lie" (2005), lan "This Is War" (2009). Band iki duwé masalah karo studhio rékaman sing gawé albumé "30 Seconds to Mars", ya iku masalah kontrak..
Kala saiki, sakmetuné &lt;a href="Matt%20Watcher"&gt;Matt Watcher&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Angels%20and%20Airwaves"&gt;Angels and Airwaves&lt;/a&gt;, posisi gitar bass digantèkaké déning &lt;a href="Tim%20Kelleher"&gt;Tim Kelleher&lt;/a&gt;.
Tekan saiki, "30 Seconds to Mars" iku wis gawé lan duwé album studhio 3, kajaba &lt;a href="30%20Seconds%20to%20Mars%20Album"&gt;30 Seconds to Mars Album&lt;/a&gt; (2002), &lt;a href="A%20Beautiful%20Lie"&gt;A Beautiful Lie&lt;/a&gt; (2005), lan &lt;a href="This%20Is%20War"&gt;This Is War&lt;/a&gt; (2009). Ora mung album studhio, nanging Tomo Miličević, Jared Leto, lan Shannon Leto uga gawé album rekaman tambahan, kaya ta &lt;a href="AOL%20Session%20Undercover"&gt;AOL Session Undercover&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="To%20the%20Edge%20of%20the%20Earth"&gt;To the Edge of the Earth&lt;/a&gt;, lan. Band iki wiwit taun 2004 uga gawé aliran musik &lt;a href="Neo%20Progressive"&gt;Neo Progressive&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Progressive%20Metal"&gt;Progressive Metal&lt;/a&gt;.
Jared Leto banjur ditepungi minangka aktor saka &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké ora tau nggawa jeneng band "30 Seconds to Mars" kanggo nglekasi misuwur. Shannon Leto, kangmas saka Jared, Shannon Leto uga wicara yèn adhiné (Jared) iku mesthi ora gelem nalika ditawani manggung, nanging nganggo jeneng Hollywood saka Jared.
Jeneng "30 Seconds To Mars" iku dijupuk saka makalah astronomi salah sawijining profesor ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Harvard"&gt;Universitas Harvard&lt;/a&gt;. Profesor iku nélakaké yèn manungsa iku mung 30 dhetik cahya saka planit Mars.
