<doc id="91576" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=91576" title="Paulus">
Paulus

Paul utawa Paulus iku jeneng pisanan kang populèr. Jeneng iki asalé saka Paulos (&lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;). Sajeroning &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt;, Paulus iku jeneng mburi kulawarga, ora tau dadi jeneng ngarep. Sajeroning &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, Paulus karan Paul.
Sapérangan tokoh wigati kang migunakaké jeneng Paulus:
<h2>Tokoh Alkitab</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Santo%20Paulus"&gt;Paulus saka Tarsus&lt;/a&gt; utawa kang ditepungi kanthi &lt;a href="Rasul%20Paulus"&gt;Rasul Paulus&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Santo%20Paulus"&gt;Santo Paulus&lt;/a&gt;. Awalé dhèwèké jenengé &lt;a href="Saulus"&gt;Saulus&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé ngalami prastawa rohani, dhèwèké ngganti jenengé dadi Paulus lan dadi salah siji rasul wigati sajeroning panyebaran &lt;a href="Injil"&gt;Injil&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Sergius%20Paulus"&gt;Sergius Paulus&lt;/a&gt;-Gubernur Pulo &lt;a href="Siprus"&gt;Siprus&lt;/a&gt; kang disebutaké sajeroning &lt;a href=""&gt;Para Rasul&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//sabdaweb.sabda.org/bible/chapter/%3Fb%3D%26c%3D13%3A7%23"&gt;13:7:&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
